<title>UK: LB Sachsen sets 200 mln mark REX-linked bond.</title>
<headline>LB Sachsen sets 200 mln mark REX-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank AG and Sachsen LB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK SACHSEN</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON   **5.50	MATURITY    09.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REX-LINKED    ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    09.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    **FIRST COUPON, THEN FLOATING RATE COUPON LINKED TO</p>
<p>		THE REX 10-YEAR INDEX X 80 ON A 30/360 DAY BASIS</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 95</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
